<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>Quick answer:</strong> The best small bedroom storage ideas keep the floor clear: use a storage bed or under-bed bins, floating shelves above the headboard and hooks behind the door, and leave about 24 inches beside a queen bed and 30 at the foot.</li>


<li>Keep walkways clear: about 24 inches beside a queen bed and 30 inches at the foot.</li>



<li>Store up, under and behind: under the bed, above the headboard and behind the door.</li>



<li>A storage bed with drawers can replace a dresser in a small room.</li>
</ul>



