<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Where Storage Fits in a Small Bedroom</h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">In a small bedroom, the biggest mistake is filling the floor. Every dresser, chair and bin you add takes away walking space, and the room starts to feel cramped. The trick is to plan storage around the walkways, not the other way around.</p>



