<p class="wp-block-paragraph">If the bedroom is simply too small for everything, look for space elsewhere: the area under the stairs often fits seasonal clothes and spare bedding, as our <a href="https://dailyspacehacks.com/under-stairs-storage-ideas/">under stairs storage ideas</a> show.</p>



